WEBVTT

01:30.160 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.400 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 26]

01:49.039 --> 01:50.370
Fourth Sister-in-law.

01:50.950 --> 01:52.560
Why did you call me here

01:52.789 --> 01:54.150
so suddenly?

01:59.310 --> 02:00.640
What is this?

02:03.480 --> 02:04.350
What?

02:05.040 --> 02:06.680
You just asked someone

02:06.680 --> 02:08.710
to bring this hairpin to Yunniang
last month.

02:08.710 --> 02:10.680
And now you don't recognize it?

02:13.680 --> 02:15.010
Fourth Sister-in-law.

02:15.190 --> 02:18.280
H-How did this hairpin
end up in your hands?

02:19.079 --> 02:20.840
You have the nerve to ask me?

02:22.079 --> 02:24.310
In front of Third Brother and Chunhua,

02:24.470 --> 02:26.329
you pretend to be a decent person.

02:26.360 --> 02:27.470
But behind their backs,

02:27.470 --> 02:29.710
you went to find
your mistress and child again,

02:29.710 --> 02:31.430
even providing for them.

02:32.240 --> 02:34.560
If I give this hairpin to Third Brother,

02:35.120 --> 02:37.800
he will flay you alive.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.870
Have mercy, Fourth Sister-in-law.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.800
If this gets out,

02:44.960 --> 02:47.590
I won't be able to survive.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.310
It's all Li Zhen's fault.

02:51.360 --> 02:52.590
If it weren't for her,

02:53.150 --> 02:54.560
how could I be living

02:54.560 --> 02:57.280
such a miserable life in the Li family?

02:57.840 --> 02:59.590
Since you hate her so much,

02:59.710 --> 03:01.400
I'll give you a chance.

03:02.080 --> 03:04.870
As long as
you have the guts and capability

03:04.870 --> 03:06.360
to do something for me,

03:07.560 --> 03:10.430
I promise to make her leave the Li family
forever.

03:11.970 --> 03:13.530
Well, I...

03:14.400 --> 03:16.680
How would I have the guts

03:16.840 --> 03:19.150
or the capability?

03:20.170 --> 03:21.490
If you succeed,

03:21.520 --> 03:24.000
I won't just find you a house in Huizhou,

03:24.240 --> 03:25.820
bringing your mistress and child over

03:25.820 --> 03:27.000
to reunite with you,

03:27.000 --> 03:29.190
but I'll also give you a good opportunity

03:29.190 --> 03:31.470
to make a name for yourself
in the Li family.

03:31.470 --> 03:33.680
No one will look down on you anymore.

03:34.130 --> 03:37.280
If you want to achieve anything
in the Li family in the future,

03:37.280 --> 03:39.000
it won't be difficult.

03:41.960 --> 03:43.290
Fourth Sister-in-law,

03:43.470 --> 03:44.930
the thing you want me to do—

03:45.680 --> 03:47.410
how confident are you about it?

03:48.870 --> 03:50.130
In this kind of matter,

03:50.590 --> 03:52.840
it's about who is willing to risk it all.

03:54.120 --> 03:55.190
In this family,

03:55.560 --> 03:57.000
only one of us

03:57.520 --> 03:59.120
can stay.

04:00.400 --> 04:02.150
As long as you do as I say,

04:02.280 --> 04:04.120
this matter will never be exposed.

04:04.120 --> 04:06.190
I'll take responsibility if it does.

04:07.080 --> 04:07.960
However,

04:08.190 --> 04:11.050
if you're willing
to live a spineless life forever,

04:12.470 --> 04:14.120
I'll just take it

04:14.390 --> 04:15.720
as I misjudged you.

04:21.160 --> 04:23.510
From Chunhua to Li Jingdong,

04:23.950 --> 04:26.280
they guard against me
like thiefs all day!

04:26.870 --> 04:28.800
I'm a man.

04:29.190 --> 04:31.450
If I live like this
for the rest of my life,

04:31.480 --> 04:33.120
what's the point?

04:40.870 --> 04:41.930
As for this matter,

04:42.830 --> 04:44.510
I agree to it.

04:45.510 --> 04:48.480
I am at your command,
Fourth Sister-in-law.

04:49.950 --> 04:52.920
The traditional materials used for Shize Ink
are different from those of Li Ink.

04:52.920 --> 04:54.240
Especially the Isinglass.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.800
Since it's not commonly used for Li Ink,

04:55.800 --> 04:57.360
we didn't have much in stock before.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.790
Now that the orders have gone up,

04:58.790 --> 05:01.190
I was thinking
we need to prepare some more.

05:02.360 --> 05:03.240
You are right.

05:03.870 --> 05:05.830
There's not enough time now,

05:05.950 --> 05:08.030
and the ink workshop
doesn't have enough hands.

05:08.030 --> 05:09.330
I heard from Grandfather

05:09.330 --> 05:10.330
that Isinglass

05:10.350 --> 05:12.510
is also commonly used
by carpenters for varnishing.

05:12.510 --> 05:15.390
Why don't we select
one or two reliable sources

05:15.430 --> 05:17.240
and purchase some Isinglass from outside?

05:17.240 --> 05:18.360
What do you think?

05:18.560 --> 05:19.820
That's the safest way.

05:19.920 --> 05:20.830
Then it's settled.

05:20.830 --> 05:21.600
Okay.

05:26.390 --> 05:27.560
Aunt Chunhua?

05:27.750 --> 05:28.950
What brings you here?

05:31.430 --> 05:32.240
Aunt,

05:32.270 --> 05:33.480
this is Songluo tea.

05:33.550 --> 05:34.430
Have a taste.

05:46.950 --> 05:47.750
Aunt,

05:48.480 --> 05:51.480
there's no need to be formal between us.

05:51.510 --> 05:52.870
Just speak your mind.

05:56.870 --> 05:57.830
Well...

05:59.510 --> 06:00.750
Decai...

06:03.380 --> 06:06.000
He wants to come back to work at Li Ink.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.720
Zhen, please don't misunderstand.

06:15.250 --> 06:17.010
I know your concerns,

06:17.180 --> 06:18.980
and I didn't really forgive him.

06:19.240 --> 06:21.430
He asked me to plead with you.

06:21.430 --> 06:23.290
I thought about it for a long time.

06:25.310 --> 06:27.440
I don't want to cause you more trouble.

06:28.120 --> 06:30.480
But since the last incident,

06:30.660 --> 06:32.060
I've been observing him,

06:32.110 --> 06:34.630
and he has indeed become much more
honest and obedient.

06:34.630 --> 06:35.750
I figured,

06:35.920 --> 06:38.870
rather than letting him
stay at home and overthink,

06:39.070 --> 06:41.720
it's better to give him a job
at the ink workshop

06:41.890 --> 06:43.020
to settle his mind.

06:45.330 --> 06:47.620
Aunt, you are my elder.

06:47.830 --> 06:49.000
Normally,

06:49.159 --> 06:51.760
I shouldn't speak ill of others
in front of you.

06:52.360 --> 06:53.800
But regarding Uncle,

06:54.159 --> 06:56.270
I've seen it all with my own eyes.

06:57.450 --> 06:59.720
He lied to you like that before,

07:00.160 --> 07:02.560
and now
he's forcing us to give him a chance.

07:02.830 --> 07:04.040
Honestly,

07:04.300 --> 07:05.190
it makes me

07:05.830 --> 07:07.160
feel uncomfortable.

07:12.600 --> 07:14.600
I feel uncomfortable too.

07:16.160 --> 07:19.190
But Decai is Run's father after all.

07:20.270 --> 07:22.000
I can't bear for Run

07:22.680 --> 07:24.870
to see his father trapped at home all day,

07:24.870 --> 07:26.830
living such a pathetic life.

07:28.800 --> 07:30.430
Run is still young now,

07:31.430 --> 07:33.680
so it's fine that he doesn't know.

07:34.630 --> 07:36.430
But when he grows up,

07:37.120 --> 07:39.630
he will inevitably be mocked by others.

07:42.800 --> 07:43.800
In that case,

07:45.120 --> 07:46.360
let him come.

07:47.310 --> 07:48.270
Really?

07:49.560 --> 07:51.950
You can't get rid of him
for the time being.

07:53.000 --> 07:53.830
It's better

07:54.190 --> 07:55.800
to put him in the ink workshop,

07:55.800 --> 07:57.260
keeping a close eye on him.

07:57.920 --> 08:00.380
Let him start as a low-level ink-maker,

08:00.680 --> 08:02.430
wearing down his temper a bit.

08:02.930 --> 08:05.890
If he truly repents in the future

08:05.950 --> 08:07.630
and wants to make ink properly,

08:07.630 --> 08:09.160
I will discuss with Uncle Jingdong

08:09.160 --> 08:11.020
how to arrange a position for him.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.360
Thank you, Zhen.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.890
Since you are new to the ink workshop,

08:30.890 --> 08:32.770
start with twisting lamp wicks.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.960
Nowadays, making ink in the ink workshop

08:34.960 --> 08:36.480
requires a large number of lamp wicks.

08:36.480 --> 08:38.150
You won't be exposed to the smoke here,

08:38.150 --> 08:40.350
and it doesn't take much effort either.

08:41.789 --> 08:42.630
Zhen.

08:43.200 --> 08:45.720
Don't you think this job is

08:45.720 --> 08:47.870
a bit of a

08:48.200 --> 08:49.550
waste of my talents?

08:50.120 --> 08:52.200
How about I help with ink mixing

08:52.270 --> 08:53.600
or manage the warehouse?

08:53.600 --> 08:54.730
In the ink workshop,

08:55.470 --> 08:57.320
you should call me Manager Zhen.

08:58.550 --> 09:00.670
Since Aunt Chunhua
entrusted you to my care,

09:00.670 --> 09:01.840
once you enter the ink workshop,

09:01.840 --> 09:04.120
you must follow my rules.

09:05.030 --> 09:06.910
Working here requires patience.

09:07.080 --> 09:08.550
Twisting lamp wicks

09:08.870 --> 09:11.000
will help

09:11.120 --> 09:12.200
calm your greedy,

09:12.200 --> 09:13.320
restless nature.

09:13.670 --> 09:14.930
Once you are tempered,

09:15.000 --> 09:16.750
I will be willing to guide you through

09:16.750 --> 09:18.390
every step of ink-making in the future.

09:18.390 --> 09:21.190
But if I find you
having the slightest disloyalty,

09:21.750 --> 09:23.150
let alone the ink workshop,

09:23.150 --> 09:24.280
the entire Li family

09:24.670 --> 09:26.440
will have no place for you.

09:29.150 --> 09:29.910
Uncle,

09:30.480 --> 09:31.480
do you understand

09:32.080 --> 09:33.200
what I said?

09:35.720 --> 09:37.840
So, can you do this job

09:38.080 --> 09:39.000
or not?

09:41.030 --> 09:43.720
I can. Of course I can.

09:45.320 --> 09:47.390
Manager Zhen, you're right.

09:49.080 --> 09:53.200
If I, Li Decai, let Chunhua down again,

09:53.320 --> 09:54.270
or show any disloyalty,

09:54.270 --> 09:56.390
may I be struck by lightning

09:56.910 --> 09:58.270
and die a horrible death.

09:58.270 --> 09:58.720
I...

10:12.910 --> 10:13.720
Uncle Jingdong.

10:13.720 --> 10:15.320
Where is that bastard?

10:16.960 --> 10:18.600
Don't worry, Uncle Jingdong.

10:18.600 --> 10:21.330
I've arranged for him
to twist lamp wicks for now.

10:23.120 --> 10:23.870
Good.

10:31.270 --> 10:32.630
I just don't believe

10:33.000 --> 10:34.120
that Li Decai

10:34.440 --> 10:37.270
can behave himself in the ink workshop.

10:37.440 --> 10:38.600
To be honest,

10:39.120 --> 10:40.580
I don't believe it either.

10:40.950 --> 10:43.080
But rather than worrying all day,

10:43.240 --> 10:45.840
it's better to keep him
in the ink workshop

10:45.840 --> 10:47.300
and keep a close eye on him.

10:50.030 --> 10:50.960
Zhen,

10:51.320 --> 10:54.270
this was originally the Sixth Branch's
own family matter.

10:54.270 --> 10:56.330
Sorry for causing you trouble again.

10:56.850 --> 11:00.240
I'll be leaving for the pine yard
in another county tomorrow.

11:00.240 --> 11:02.080
It will take at least 10 days.

11:02.410 --> 11:05.540
Please take good care of the family
and the ink workshop.

11:06.670 --> 11:08.030
Rest assured, Uncle Jingdong.

11:08.030 --> 11:09.390
I will do my best.

11:09.550 --> 11:12.750
It's tough working away from home.
Take care of yourself.

11:13.910 --> 11:14.720
Doggie.

11:18.480 --> 11:21.600
This is the Isinglass merchant
that Manager Zhen and I selected.

11:21.600 --> 11:22.510
Go make a trip

11:22.670 --> 11:24.400
and have them deliver the Isinglass
as soon as possible.

11:24.400 --> 11:25.680
Okay, I'll go then.

11:50.630 --> 11:51.840
Rest assured.

11:51.840 --> 11:53.960
My isinglass is perfectly fine.

11:56.410 --> 11:57.840
Why...

11:57.910 --> 11:59.550
Why are you testing it again?

12:00.170 --> 12:02.430
Is there a problem with testing it again?

12:05.360 --> 12:06.910
There's no problem.

12:07.150 --> 12:08.110
Manager Zhen.

12:08.390 --> 12:09.360
This isinglass was all

12:09.360 --> 12:12.240
prepared according to
Steward Shao's requirements.

12:12.240 --> 12:13.750
We use fish from our own farm.

12:13.750 --> 12:15.720
As soon as they are caught, we extract
the bladders and boil them into isinglass.

12:15.720 --> 12:17.150
Within a hundred li of Huizhou,

12:17.150 --> 12:18.150
you can ask around,

12:18.150 --> 12:20.790
and you won't find any better isinglass
than mine.

12:20.790 --> 12:22.200
You might not know, sir,

12:22.390 --> 12:23.910
but when Li Ink purchases glue,

12:23.910 --> 12:25.780
we inspect every barrel without exception.

12:25.780 --> 12:27.050
We take turns inspecting them,

12:27.050 --> 12:28.200
so we can be fully assured, right?

12:28.200 --> 12:29.600
Of course.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.910
Put it in storage.

12:32.270 --> 12:33.870
You'll surely be satisfied.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.950
Come on, give me the list.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.630
Come with me to get it stamped.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.320
Alright.

12:44.390 --> 12:45.000
This way.

12:57.720 --> 12:59.650
Everyone, put in a bit more effort.

13:00.870 --> 13:02.750
This glue is actually not bad.

13:05.750 --> 13:06.480
Fang.

13:06.950 --> 13:08.340
The ink should be thoroughly mixed.

13:08.340 --> 13:09.940
Put some more effort into it.

13:10.960 --> 13:11.750
Zhen.

13:12.620 --> 13:14.390
This ink will probably need a whole night
to be mixed.

13:14.390 --> 13:15.750
Why don't you go back, get some sleep,

13:15.750 --> 13:17.050
and come back in the morning
to inspect it?

13:17.050 --> 13:18.890
No, I'm not at ease.

13:19.030 --> 13:20.440
I'd better stay with you.

13:20.550 --> 13:22.030
The rainy season
came a bit early this year.

13:22.030 --> 13:23.430
The glue goes bad easily.

13:24.960 --> 13:25.870
Everyone!

13:25.960 --> 13:27.270
Thanks for your hard work!

13:27.270 --> 13:28.790
We have to work through the night!

13:28.790 --> 13:30.630
Please put in a bit more effort!

13:30.840 --> 13:32.270
-Okay.
-Okay!

13:33.390 --> 13:35.240
The smell here is really bad.

13:35.600 --> 13:37.000
You're just waiting if you stay here.

13:37.000 --> 13:38.330
Why don't you go inside?

13:38.360 --> 13:39.670
I'll call you when it's done.

13:39.670 --> 13:41.790
Okay, I'll go inside for a bit.

13:41.870 --> 13:42.910
I'll take over for you in a while.

13:42.910 --> 13:43.480
Okay.

13:43.750 --> 13:44.670
Thanks for your hard work, Zhengshen.

13:44.670 --> 13:45.400
Don't worry.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.120
Why are you here?

14:10.000 --> 14:10.670
Look.

14:13.720 --> 14:14.960
My mother made this?

14:15.120 --> 14:16.850
Why did she have you deliver it?

14:17.670 --> 14:20.270
I ran into your mother
on my way to the ink workshop.

14:20.270 --> 14:21.030
She said she guessed

14:21.030 --> 14:23.000
you'd be staying up all night here,

14:23.030 --> 14:24.960
so she made some chicken soup for you.

14:24.960 --> 14:26.630
So I volunteered

14:26.630 --> 14:28.270
to be an errand boy

14:28.270 --> 14:29.630
and bring it to you.

14:31.600 --> 14:32.320
But...

14:32.470 --> 14:34.630
how did you know your mother
made this soup?

14:34.630 --> 14:36.080
I could smell it.

14:36.360 --> 14:37.390
When my mother makes soup,

14:37.390 --> 14:39.750
she likes to add tangerine peel
and astragalus.

14:39.750 --> 14:41.200
I grew up drinking it,

14:41.200 --> 14:42.910
so I could recognize it
from the smell alone.

14:42.910 --> 14:44.630
You have a good nose.

14:44.750 --> 14:46.000
Of course.

14:46.030 --> 14:47.840
In an ink-making family like ours,

14:47.840 --> 14:49.790
we had to practice smelling
and identifying ink

14:49.790 --> 14:51.720
blindfolded from a young age.

14:52.440 --> 14:54.150
When we were kids,
Zhengshen and my brother

14:54.150 --> 14:55.200
hated it the most.

14:55.200 --> 14:57.030
But I was especially good at it.

14:57.630 --> 15:00.840
I was always winning praise
from my grandfather

15:01.000 --> 15:02.460
and Seventh Grandmother.

15:03.200 --> 15:05.670
Back then, every time I guessed right,

15:05.840 --> 15:08.970
Seventh Grandmother would give me
a piece of sugar cake.

15:10.000 --> 15:11.860
At first, I trained my nose so hard

15:12.080 --> 15:13.670
just for the sugar cakes.

15:23.030 --> 15:25.030
When Seventh Grandmother wakes up,

15:25.440 --> 15:27.510
I'll show her the Origin Ink

15:27.600 --> 15:29.000
and Shize Ink.

15:29.240 --> 15:31.600
Then I'll ask her for two more pieces

15:32.430 --> 15:34.000
of sugar cake.

15:36.720 --> 15:39.670
There used to be
ancient lacquer-soot ink and Fu Jin Ink.

15:39.670 --> 15:42.390
Now there's the Origin Ink and Shize Ink.

15:42.580 --> 15:43.740
I believe that in the future,

15:43.740 --> 15:45.960
you'll make even more
and even better ink.

15:45.960 --> 15:48.960
By then, Seventh Old Madam
will be able to see them all.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.670
Speaking of ink-making,

15:57.390 --> 15:58.600
it's a coincidence.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.760
When you first came to Huizhou,

16:01.870 --> 16:03.870
I just started learning to make ink.

16:04.480 --> 16:05.670
Up to now,

16:05.670 --> 16:07.630
I have made 4 kinds of ink.

16:08.790 --> 16:11.150
Old ink makers,

16:11.360 --> 16:12.890
including my grandfather,

16:12.910 --> 16:14.200
at most,

16:14.240 --> 16:16.720
only make a few good pieces
of ink in their lifetime.

16:16.720 --> 16:18.380
All these opportunities I had

16:18.670 --> 16:20.000
were because of you.

16:21.150 --> 16:22.480
Then you should say

16:23.000 --> 16:25.550
my judgment is one of a kind.

16:25.670 --> 16:27.750
I bring luck to whoever I invest in.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.480
Who was it that,

16:29.510 --> 16:30.600
because of the Tribute Ink incident,

16:30.600 --> 16:32.150
even lost his own job?

16:33.670 --> 16:35.200
You should just stay by my side

16:35.200 --> 16:37.330
and think about how to make a comeback.

16:38.320 --> 16:40.670
But even if
you're reinstated in the future,

16:40.670 --> 16:41.840
we can still

16:41.840 --> 16:43.620
do Shize Ink business together.

16:43.620 --> 16:46.220
We'll sell Shize Ink
all the way to the Capital.

16:46.610 --> 16:48.810
If we can sell it to a Number One Scholar,

16:48.960 --> 16:51.030
we'll make a fortune.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.960
Alright, alright, I'll be waiting.

17:00.550 --> 17:01.630
What's that smell?

17:08.069 --> 17:08.880
What's wrong?

17:11.310 --> 17:12.480
Everyone, stop!

17:12.720 --> 17:13.720
Stop!

17:14.000 --> 17:15.069
Stop, all of you!

17:31.830 --> 17:32.790
Indeed.

17:34.110 --> 17:35.720
Why has all the glue gone bad?

17:36.160 --> 17:36.920
Zhen,

17:37.200 --> 17:38.070
I checked it.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.110
The cowhide glue is fine.

17:39.110 --> 17:40.310
It's just the Isinglass—

17:40.310 --> 17:41.550
this stuff is especially sensitive
to moisture.

17:41.550 --> 17:43.000
Could it be the rain?

17:44.070 --> 17:45.470
This little rain is fine.

17:46.000 --> 17:47.750
Besides, these walls were mixed

17:47.750 --> 17:49.200
with moisture-resistant Sichuan pepper.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.400
Even if the floor had dampness rising,

17:50.400 --> 17:52.730
it wouldn't turn out like this overnight.

17:54.200 --> 17:55.790
All of the glue was checked
bucket by bucket

17:55.790 --> 17:57.830
by me and Steward Shao
before being stored.

17:57.830 --> 17:59.560
How could they suddenly spoil?

18:00.680 --> 18:02.160
And the lock is fine.

18:02.240 --> 18:04.160
I checked it. No sign of tampering.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.400
And last time, it was Steward Shao and I

18:05.400 --> 18:06.730
who locked it together.

18:13.270 --> 18:15.480
Zhengshen, Master Qi,

18:16.540 --> 18:18.140
all the mixed ink and boiled glue tonight

18:18.140 --> 18:19.070
must not be discarded.

18:19.070 --> 18:19.640
Also,

18:20.030 --> 18:21.310
have the workers
who were making ink tonight

18:21.310 --> 18:23.550
stay here for the night for now.

18:24.160 --> 18:26.500
Until this matter is investigated clearly,

18:26.500 --> 18:28.700
it must be kept strictly confidential.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.750
Don't worry. Here's the key.

18:53.200 --> 18:55.270
This is serious.

18:55.480 --> 18:58.270
Shize Ink is waiting for our delivery.

18:58.760 --> 18:59.560
Manager Zhen,

18:59.810 --> 19:01.610
we must quickly figure out a way

19:01.640 --> 19:03.000
to remedy this in time.

19:03.190 --> 19:04.590
As for how to remedy this,

19:04.920 --> 19:07.110
you don't need to worry about it, Uncle.

19:07.110 --> 19:09.000
I'll figure it out.

19:09.650 --> 19:11.070
You were the one who inspected the glue,

19:11.070 --> 19:12.840
and you were the one
who signed off on the order.

19:12.840 --> 19:14.770
What else is there to investigate?

19:14.920 --> 19:16.070
Are you going to investigate

19:16.070 --> 19:18.070
who forged your handwriting

19:18.190 --> 19:19.590
or who cast a spell on you?

19:19.790 --> 19:21.200
I inspected the glue.

19:21.510 --> 19:23.920
There was no problem
before it went into the warehouse.

19:23.920 --> 19:24.720
That's right.

19:24.750 --> 19:27.080
Manager Zhen and I inspected it together.

19:27.200 --> 19:29.310
The glue was of good quality
when it arrived.

19:29.310 --> 19:31.790
Someone must have tampered with it
after it was stored.

19:31.790 --> 19:34.440
We really need
to investigate this thoroughly.

19:34.440 --> 19:36.200
That's right. I saw it too.

19:36.830 --> 19:39.830
Then let's investigate
those who have the keys to the warehouse.

19:39.830 --> 19:41.680
Then the truth will naturally come out.

19:41.680 --> 19:42.640
The keys to the warehouse—

19:42.640 --> 19:44.830
Steward Shao, Uncle Jingdong, and I

19:45.310 --> 19:46.350
each have one.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.590
There.

19:49.920 --> 19:50.880
Sister-in-law,

19:51.510 --> 19:53.440
our family has always been fair.

19:53.590 --> 19:55.520
Now that Third Brother is not here,

19:55.720 --> 19:57.640
you are the only one
who can take charge here.

19:57.640 --> 19:59.080
As a manager, Zhen

19:59.180 --> 20:00.840
is clearly incompetent.

20:01.000 --> 20:02.000
In my opinion,

20:02.030 --> 20:04.560
we should revoke
her managerial power first.

20:04.580 --> 20:05.340
Jiangyue.

20:05.370 --> 20:07.810
Then see how big this mess is

20:08.160 --> 20:09.200
and how to fix it.

20:10.510 --> 20:11.440
Fourth Aunt,

20:12.380 --> 20:14.580
before it is thoroughly investigated,

20:14.750 --> 20:15.880
I will not

20:16.210 --> 20:17.940
hand over my managerial power.

20:18.920 --> 20:19.830
Zhen.

20:20.550 --> 20:21.480
Eldest Aunt.

20:22.400 --> 20:23.860
The top priority right now

20:23.920 --> 20:25.350
is to find out the truth,

20:25.790 --> 20:27.240
replenish the raw materials,

20:27.240 --> 20:29.240
and rush out this batch of Shize Ink.

20:29.960 --> 20:31.290
For the sake of this ink,

20:31.400 --> 20:32.680
I can't step down.

20:33.860 --> 20:35.240
After the ink is delivered,

20:35.240 --> 20:37.200
if it is indeed proven
to be my negligence,

20:37.200 --> 20:38.680
I won't need anyone to say anything.

20:38.680 --> 20:41.480
I will ask Seventh Grandmother
for punishment myself.

20:41.480 --> 20:42.190
Zhen,

20:42.550 --> 20:44.110
if we remake the ink,

20:44.110 --> 20:45.240
is there still time?

20:45.400 --> 20:48.000
If we remedy it right away,
we can still make it.

20:49.680 --> 20:50.440
Good.

20:51.480 --> 20:53.640
Usually, in this family,

20:53.640 --> 20:56.270
my words don't carry much weight.

20:56.810 --> 20:58.960
But today, with Third Brother
not being here,

20:58.960 --> 21:01.720
this family needs a man

21:01.720 --> 21:03.160
to step up and take charge,

21:03.160 --> 21:05.360
so we can discuss this properly, right?

21:05.710 --> 21:07.020
Stop talking about unrelated things.

21:07.020 --> 21:08.200
Just get straight to the point.

21:08.200 --> 21:08.960
Decai,

21:09.480 --> 21:10.750
if you have something to say,

21:10.750 --> 21:11.790
just say it.

21:12.070 --> 21:13.730
I've heard these past few days

21:14.110 --> 21:15.250
that ever since our family

21:15.250 --> 21:17.590
used the dug-out rosin oil to make ink,

21:17.590 --> 21:19.480
and the news spread,

21:19.720 --> 21:21.550
people everywhere have been imitating us.

21:21.550 --> 21:22.830
Those who do it well

21:22.930 --> 21:24.210
number quite a few.

21:24.270 --> 21:27.270
It just so happens
that with the managers of these places,

21:27.270 --> 21:28.730
I am somewhat acquainted.

21:29.270 --> 21:31.790
Time is tight now.

21:31.920 --> 21:34.070
Why don't you let me make a trip

21:34.110 --> 21:37.270
and buy a batch of ink

21:37.270 --> 21:38.440
similar to Shize Ink

21:38.550 --> 21:40.160
to solve the urgent problem?

21:41.440 --> 21:44.070
That seems like a good idea.

21:46.680 --> 21:49.310
Uncle, you've already resigned
from the merchant job.

21:49.310 --> 21:52.240
I didn't expect you to still be

21:52.440 --> 21:54.770
so well-informed about the news outside.

21:54.880 --> 21:57.110
This is the only way.

21:58.920 --> 21:59.850
Sister-in-law,

21:59.880 --> 22:01.350
if you think

22:01.520 --> 22:03.280
this method is feasible,

22:03.310 --> 22:05.550
please give me some money.

22:05.750 --> 22:06.350
By the way,

22:07.480 --> 22:11.320
it might be inappropriate to talk to them

22:11.350 --> 22:12.810
with my current identity.

22:13.030 --> 22:14.920
If we want to make a deal,

22:14.940 --> 22:19.100
please lend me the seal for a few days,
Manager Zhen.

22:19.950 --> 22:22.680
You've been in the ink workshop
for less than half a month

22:22.680 --> 22:24.740
and haven't twisted many lamp wicks.

22:24.790 --> 22:27.550
So your mind has been all on this?

22:28.070 --> 22:30.000
I'll lay it out here today.

22:31.180 --> 22:33.780
The current head
of the Li family is me, Li Zhen.

22:34.000 --> 22:36.060
You won't get a single penny you want.

22:36.310 --> 22:39.240
And don't even think about
the family seal.

22:40.880 --> 22:42.550
Shize Ink is Shize Ink.

22:43.400 --> 22:45.680
Delivering other ink would be fraud.

22:46.510 --> 22:47.720
If we can't deliver the ink,

22:47.720 --> 22:48.920
I'd rather lose money

22:49.400 --> 22:51.600
than do this self-deceiving business.

22:52.000 --> 22:52.920
Manager Zhen!

22:57.590 --> 22:58.550
Manager Zhen.

23:00.310 --> 23:02.510
Mr. Zhang went to the ink workshop
with the Education Official.

23:02.510 --> 23:03.910
The Education Official?

23:04.070 --> 23:05.440
Why did they go to the ink workshop?

23:05.440 --> 23:07.900
They heard there was a problem
with Shize Ink

23:08.070 --> 23:10.000
and came to demand an explanation.

23:11.510 --> 23:12.440
Heard?

23:16.480 --> 23:17.790
Again?

23:27.920 --> 23:30.270
Manager Zhen, you are here.

23:35.790 --> 23:38.160
My Lord, you visited so early.

23:38.270 --> 23:40.780
I, Li Zhen, Manager of Li Ink,
failed to welcome you.

23:40.780 --> 23:41.910
Please forgive me.

23:43.200 --> 23:44.300
Manager Li.

23:44.880 --> 23:46.960
The Shize Ink developed by Li Ink

23:45.430 --> 23:48.160
[Education Official of Huizhou]

23:47.390 --> 23:50.190
has been benefiting
the poor students in Huizhou.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.950
Shize Ink has become

23:51.980 --> 23:55.270
the first choice for Huizhou students
taking the autumn imperial examination.

23:55.270 --> 23:57.160
This was supposed to be a great tale.

23:57.160 --> 24:00.350
However, I heard from
Mr. Zhang and the others

24:00.750 --> 24:04.110
that there is a problem
with the Shize Ink you are making.

24:04.680 --> 24:09.200
I personally named
and recommended this ink.

24:09.870 --> 24:12.460
If something really goes wrong,

24:13.400 --> 24:16.000
how am I supposed
to explain it to the students?

24:16.160 --> 24:17.110
Steward Shao,

24:17.240 --> 24:18.680
is there a problem with our ink?

24:18.680 --> 24:19.350
No.

24:19.510 --> 24:21.240
Doggie, did you hear anything?

24:23.200 --> 24:23.720
Well...

24:23.880 --> 24:25.350
we don't even know about it.

24:25.350 --> 24:26.590
Where did you

24:26.590 --> 24:28.590
hear this rumor from?

24:28.990 --> 24:29.730
Li Zhen,

24:30.440 --> 24:33.310
the news
came right from your ink workshop.

24:34.500 --> 24:35.500
Our ink workshop?

24:35.960 --> 24:38.590
So Mr. Zhang
even knows someone in our ink workshop?

24:38.590 --> 24:39.790
Who is it?

24:39.880 --> 24:41.680
It's none of your business
who I heard it from.

24:41.680 --> 24:43.790
Just tell me
if the glue you use to make the ink

24:43.790 --> 24:45.030
has a problem.

24:45.070 --> 24:46.880
Is all the Shize Ink

24:46.880 --> 24:48.350
you made faulty?

24:48.440 --> 24:51.440
If the Education Official's reputation
is ruined because of this,

24:51.440 --> 24:53.320
and the students start protesting,

24:53.320 --> 24:55.050
can you bear the consequences?

24:55.400 --> 24:56.930
This is absolutely untrue.

24:57.960 --> 24:59.070
My Lord,

24:59.200 --> 25:00.510
our Li Ink has a reputation in Huizhou

25:00.510 --> 25:01.920
for over a hundred years.

25:02.030 --> 25:04.290
We have never done business in bad faith.

25:04.440 --> 25:05.830
I, Li Zhen, assure you that

25:05.830 --> 25:07.160
when the delivery date arrives,

25:07.160 --> 25:09.270
Li Ink will deliver the exact amount.

25:09.450 --> 25:12.370
Since you say
the ink can be delivered as promised,

25:12.750 --> 25:16.000
then take us all to see the ink we ordered

25:16.030 --> 25:17.880
and check if it's really fine.

25:18.400 --> 25:19.000
Please.

25:20.240 --> 25:21.160
My Lord.

25:21.240 --> 25:22.770
My Lord, you might not know,

25:23.270 --> 25:24.960
but we have a rule in ink-making.

25:24.960 --> 25:27.920
The ink-making area is important,
so no unrelated personnel are allowed inside.

25:27.920 --> 25:29.270
What a stupid rule!

25:29.350 --> 25:31.360
I think you are just feeling guilty.

25:34.510 --> 25:36.070
Our Manager Zhen

25:36.480 --> 25:37.920
hasn't let you in yet.

25:39.880 --> 25:40.640
My Lord.

25:40.640 --> 25:41.720
You might not know,

25:41.750 --> 25:43.310
but the ink-making process is complex.

25:43.310 --> 25:45.750
A slight mistake can cause it to spoil.

25:45.960 --> 25:48.440
Besides, the delivery date
hasn't arrived yet.

25:48.440 --> 25:50.880
There's no reason
to come and make things difficult for us.

25:50.880 --> 25:52.310
If you force your way in

25:52.310 --> 25:53.720
and the ink really spoils,

25:53.720 --> 25:54.620
then how am I supposed to

25:54.620 --> 25:56.830
explain it to you, My Lord?

25:56.990 --> 25:59.140
If the students start protesting,

25:59.200 --> 26:02.270
will they go to the Education Official,

26:02.880 --> 26:05.110
or to you, Mr. Zhang?

26:09.840 --> 26:10.680
Mr. Zhang.

26:11.810 --> 26:13.740
The ink workshop has its own rules.

26:13.790 --> 26:16.000
Let's not break them.

26:17.880 --> 26:19.270
Thank you, My Lord.

26:22.000 --> 26:24.350
The autumn imperial examination
is not a trifling matter.

26:24.350 --> 26:27.200
Please look out for yourselves.

26:28.070 --> 26:29.510
Don't make things difficult for me.

26:29.510 --> 26:30.680
I understand!

26:30.680 --> 26:32.030
Farewell, My Lord.

26:32.470 --> 26:33.920
Farewell, My Lord.

26:46.920 --> 26:48.880
Can you understand everything in school?

26:48.880 --> 26:49.810
Sister-in-law.

26:51.830 --> 26:53.490
I have something to say to you.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.640
What is it?

26:57.790 --> 26:59.520
What exactly are you planning?

26:59.650 --> 27:02.680
I heard that girl even dared
to deceive the Education Official.

27:02.680 --> 27:04.680
She managed to bluff through today,

27:04.680 --> 27:07.610
but what if
she can't deliver the goods in the future?

27:07.920 --> 27:09.550
Are you just going to watch

27:09.550 --> 27:11.550
the Li family be dragged down by her?

27:12.000 --> 27:13.550
I understand what you mean,

27:14.310 --> 27:16.200
but we should trust Zhen.

27:16.440 --> 27:18.840
If we trust her,
this family will be ruined.

27:20.360 --> 27:21.290
Sister-in-law,

27:22.000 --> 27:23.400
I may have made mistakes,

27:24.000 --> 27:26.070
but I am
a daughter-in-law of the Li family.

27:26.070 --> 27:27.730
My heart is with the Li family.

27:28.750 --> 27:30.310
Li Zhen is not.

27:31.270 --> 27:33.400
She is someone
we kicked out of the family.

27:33.400 --> 27:35.060
No matter how good things are,

27:36.160 --> 27:38.220
can she not hold a grudge in her heart?

27:39.240 --> 27:41.480
After all, she's not our family.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.480
You can be tolerant on the surface,

27:43.480 --> 27:45.680
but you have to be on guard in your heart.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.590
Then what do you think

27:48.200 --> 27:49.550
we should do?

27:50.680 --> 27:52.160
Call on the clan elders

27:53.610 --> 27:55.270
and force Li Zhen to step down.

28:09.030 --> 28:11.590
Time is tight now.

28:11.680 --> 28:13.880
Why don't you let me make a trip

28:13.920 --> 28:17.030
and buy a batch of ink

28:17.030 --> 28:18.210
similar to Shize Ink

28:19.160 --> 28:20.880
to solve the urgent problem?

28:21.240 --> 28:23.030
Shize Ink is Shize Ink.

28:23.200 --> 28:24.400
If we can't deliver the ink,

28:24.400 --> 28:25.640
I'd rather lose money

28:26.030 --> 28:28.510
than do this self-deceiving business.

28:32.040 --> 28:34.490
Shize Ink has become
the first choice for Huizhou students

28:34.490 --> 28:36.680
taking the autumn imperial examination.

28:36.680 --> 28:39.510
If something really goes wrong,

28:39.680 --> 28:42.280
how am I supposed to explain it
to the students?

28:50.000 --> 28:50.880
Mother,

28:52.240 --> 28:53.270
don't worry.

28:53.880 --> 28:56.740
Even if we really have to compensate
for this order,

28:56.920 --> 28:58.590
as long as I have hands and feet,

28:58.590 --> 29:00.030
I can be like Zhen,

29:00.510 --> 29:03.350
starting from making lampblack
for other ink workshops

29:03.350 --> 29:06.030
and earning the Li family back bit by bit.

29:06.350 --> 29:07.400
Good boy.

29:08.400 --> 29:11.480
The most important thing for you now
is to study hard.

29:12.160 --> 29:14.620
You don't need to worry about
anything else.

29:22.480 --> 29:24.810
Shize Ink is different from other orders.

29:25.440 --> 29:26.720
I actually think

29:27.030 --> 29:29.550
what Decai said is also a way.

29:30.260 --> 29:32.460
Even if it's not the ink of our Li family,

29:32.790 --> 29:34.830
it's better than
having nothing to deliver.

29:34.830 --> 29:37.290
You heard
what the Education Official said.

29:37.440 --> 29:39.070
If we really can't deliver the ink

29:39.070 --> 29:40.440
and affect
the autumn imperial examination,

29:40.440 --> 29:42.070
we will go to jail.

29:42.920 --> 29:43.880
Eldest Aunt,

29:43.960 --> 29:44.960
think about it.

29:45.200 --> 29:46.510
Something has just happened
in our ink workshop,

29:46.510 --> 29:49.570
and Li Decai already had
a full set of countermeasures.

29:49.880 --> 29:51.250
First he said he would collect other ink,

29:51.250 --> 29:53.960
then he said we needed money,

29:54.340 --> 29:56.400
and he even asked for our family seal.

29:57.920 --> 29:58.880
Master Qi watches

29:58.880 --> 30:00.510
this ink workshop very closely.

30:00.510 --> 30:02.270
It would never leak any news.

30:03.040 --> 30:05.590
But the Education Official
came in the blink of an eye.

30:05.590 --> 30:06.720
Think about it carefully.

30:06.720 --> 30:09.200
All of this is definitely related
to Li Decai.

30:09.200 --> 30:10.240
You mean

30:10.550 --> 30:13.030
this is all Decai's doing?

30:13.030 --> 30:13.790
Exactly.

30:14.550 --> 30:15.750
How is that possible?

30:15.750 --> 30:17.350
How could he have the guts?

30:20.000 --> 30:22.070
Even if he couldn't do it all by himself,

30:22.070 --> 30:22.960
behind this,

30:23.350 --> 30:24.590
there must be someone else.

30:24.590 --> 30:25.640
You're right.

30:25.640 --> 30:27.660
We must investigate
what needs to be investigated.

30:27.660 --> 30:29.840
But the most important thing right now
is to deliver the ink.

30:29.840 --> 30:31.360
You understand?

30:31.720 --> 30:32.880
The only way now

30:32.880 --> 30:34.550
is the idea Decai came up with.

30:34.550 --> 30:36.440
Why won't you give it a try?

30:36.680 --> 30:37.640
Eldest Aunt,

30:37.790 --> 30:38.790
I've told you so much.

30:38.790 --> 30:40.590
Why don't you still understand?

30:41.110 --> 30:43.030
If I really listen to Li Decai,

30:43.110 --> 30:45.240
then our Li family will truly be ruined.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.350
Zhen,

30:46.350 --> 30:47.440
do you not believe him,

30:47.440 --> 30:50.700
or are you afraid
someone will take your manager position?

31:01.920 --> 31:03.640
This management power was entrusted

31:03.640 --> 31:05.550
personally to me by Seventh Grandmother.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.880
If it is to be taken back,

31:06.920 --> 31:08.920
she has to take it back herself.

31:10.200 --> 31:11.000
I won't

31:11.400 --> 31:13.130
hand Li Ink over to anyone else.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.070
Eldest Aunt,

31:16.800 --> 31:18.790
I have other things to do
at the ink workshop.

31:18.790 --> 31:20.050
I will get back to work.

31:20.720 --> 31:22.780
You should think about it carefully.

32:09.920 --> 32:10.790
Zhen!

32:11.240 --> 32:12.030
Zhen!

32:12.310 --> 32:12.590
Zhen!

32:12.590 --> 32:13.790
I know what happened to the glue!

32:13.790 --> 32:14.440
Bad news.

32:14.440 --> 32:16.900
Eldest Aunt
invited all the Li clan elders over.

32:16.900 --> 32:20.360
Now they want you to return to
the main family to be questioned.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.300
Elder, please.

32:37.740 --> 32:39.850
Greetings, Elders.

32:40.750 --> 32:42.750
Seventh Old Madam is seriously ill.

32:42.960 --> 32:45.200
There are no elders
holding the fort at home,

32:45.200 --> 32:47.830
and you actually made such a big mess.

32:48.240 --> 32:50.510
If Sun hadn't told me,

32:50.780 --> 32:53.440
Li Ink might have been ruined

32:54.400 --> 32:55.750
in your hands.

32:56.200 --> 32:58.400
For the long-term sake of Li Ink,

32:58.640 --> 33:02.160
hand over the family seal.

33:02.720 --> 33:04.350
I have just arrived here

33:05.070 --> 33:07.480
and was lectured by you.

33:08.400 --> 33:10.720
Please allow me to defend myself.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.240
Regarding the Isinglass incident,

33:13.240 --> 33:14.700
I have found out the truth.

33:14.880 --> 33:17.010
Please make a clear judgment, Elders.

33:17.550 --> 33:18.270
Doggie.

33:29.400 --> 33:31.330
Sorry to trouble you, Fourth Aunt.

33:32.640 --> 33:33.270
Well...

33:37.030 --> 33:38.360
Thank you, Fourth Aunt.

34:05.550 --> 34:06.830
Please look, Elders.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.780
Regarding the Isinglass,

34:09.960 --> 34:12.230
someone tampered with the glue bucket.

34:12.710 --> 34:14.000
They replaced the bottom of the bucket

34:14.000 --> 34:15.730
but didn't make it waterproof.

34:15.920 --> 34:17.920
It has been raining continuously
these days,

34:17.920 --> 34:19.230
and the bottom got damp,

34:19.230 --> 34:21.670
which caused the Isinglass to rot.

34:22.670 --> 34:23.510
Zhen.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.909
It seems it really was

34:26.360 --> 34:27.670
the glue merchant's doing.

34:27.670 --> 34:30.000
Who is this person? Have they been caught?

34:30.230 --> 34:31.560
When I went to catch him,

34:31.960 --> 34:33.820
this person had already run away.

34:35.110 --> 34:37.110
Now things are clear.

34:37.360 --> 34:38.690
The Isinglass incident

34:38.960 --> 34:41.440
was someone deliberately trying
to harm the Li family.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.500
It's highly likely

34:43.760 --> 34:45.280
there was an inside job.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.130
At the ink workshop,

34:47.690 --> 34:50.590
I have already sent people
to buy new Isinglass urgently

34:50.590 --> 34:52.230
to rush the production of Shize Ink.

34:52.230 --> 34:53.960
Please rest assured, Elders.

34:55.320 --> 34:57.800
We must catch the saboteur,

34:58.170 --> 35:00.950
but the priority now
is to deliver the ink.

35:01.630 --> 35:02.440
I think

35:02.880 --> 35:06.360
we should let Decai buy
ready-made ink as soon as possible.

35:06.510 --> 35:08.280
Ensuring on-time delivery

35:08.400 --> 35:10.000
is the most important thing.

35:10.070 --> 35:10.710
Yes.

35:10.840 --> 35:11.920
Wanyi,

35:12.400 --> 35:14.800
let's stick to our agreed plan.

35:17.010 --> 35:18.010
Eldest Aunt.

35:19.550 --> 35:21.150
The most important thing now

35:21.150 --> 35:22.400
is to deliver the ink.

35:23.030 --> 35:23.840
Zhen,

35:24.760 --> 35:26.320
why don't you hand it over for now?

35:26.320 --> 35:27.320
Eldest Aunt,

35:27.880 --> 35:30.230
buying other ink is like
drinking poison to quench thirst.

35:30.230 --> 35:31.960
It will cause endless trouble.

35:32.320 --> 35:33.590
I will absolutely not

35:34.190 --> 35:35.650
hand the family seal over.

35:36.550 --> 35:37.760
Just as I expected.

35:38.150 --> 35:39.360
Li Zhen

35:39.400 --> 35:42.110
is really stubborn and unreasonable!

35:42.510 --> 35:43.770
Don't be angry, Elder.

35:44.110 --> 35:45.190
Li Zhen is young.

35:45.190 --> 35:47.440
She doesn't know
the gravity of the matter.

35:47.440 --> 35:50.360
I think she refuses to hand over the seal

35:50.920 --> 35:52.920
because she doesn't trust Li Decai.

35:53.400 --> 35:55.030
I do have a solution.

35:55.190 --> 35:58.360
Why not let Li Zhen
give the seal to Wanyi,

35:58.400 --> 36:01.000
and have her and Decai
buy the ink together?

36:01.480 --> 36:02.480
It will convince everyone

36:02.480 --> 36:04.590
and solve our urgent problem.

36:06.110 --> 36:07.590
Exactly.

36:08.070 --> 36:10.400
I have only learned about ink
for a few days,

36:10.400 --> 36:13.230
and I'm Li family's matrilocal son-in-law.

36:14.000 --> 36:15.510
It's normal that Zhen

36:15.920 --> 36:17.070
doesn't trust me.

36:17.590 --> 36:20.320
But if Wanyi can go with me,

36:20.360 --> 36:22.890
it will definitely
be much more appropriate.

36:23.150 --> 36:25.110
I think this plan is feasible.

36:25.510 --> 36:27.880
Wanyi is kind-hearted.

36:28.150 --> 36:30.760
She has been with
the Seventh Old Madam the longest.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.470
You handle this.

36:32.630 --> 36:33.440
Decai,

36:33.800 --> 36:35.630
you will assist her.

36:36.190 --> 36:36.840
Yes.

36:38.000 --> 36:38.880
Li Decai!

36:39.480 --> 36:41.480
I've been too nice to you, haven't I?

36:41.630 --> 36:42.190
Don't you know

36:42.190 --> 36:43.960
why I don't trust you?

36:44.590 --> 36:46.030
You kept a mistress

36:46.030 --> 36:49.080
and secretly sold raw lacquer to make money
without Aunt Chunhua's knowledge.

36:49.080 --> 36:51.720
If Aunt Chunhua hadn't pleaded repeatedly,

36:52.000 --> 36:54.400
how could I let you
work at the ink workshop?

36:55.000 --> 36:56.590
You've only been at the ink workshop
for a few days,

36:56.590 --> 36:58.710
and then the Isinglass incident happened.

36:58.710 --> 37:00.750
How could a traitor like you

37:01.070 --> 37:03.190
be so kind to the Li family?

37:03.480 --> 37:04.280
Let me ask you.

37:04.710 --> 37:05.800
Did you and those ink merchants

37:05.800 --> 37:07.230
collude long ago,

37:07.400 --> 37:09.630
just waiting
to swindle the Li family's money?

37:09.630 --> 37:10.590
Or rather,

37:10.800 --> 37:12.330
in the Isinglass incident,

37:12.400 --> 37:14.710
you were the one working from the inside?

37:18.150 --> 37:18.960
Li Zhen!

37:19.670 --> 37:21.400
You don't want to hand over
the family seal,

37:21.400 --> 37:23.550
so you're just accusing me falsely.

37:23.630 --> 37:27.030
Although I'm a matrilocal husband
whose words carry no weight,

37:27.030 --> 37:28.440
I won't allow you

37:28.480 --> 37:30.710
to wrong me for no reason!

37:31.360 --> 37:32.150
Li Decai!

37:32.150 --> 37:33.150
For the Li family,

37:33.150 --> 37:34.880
I've worked my heart out

37:35.230 --> 37:37.280
and have always been loyal.

37:39.960 --> 37:42.150
I shouldn't have spared you
for the raw lacquer incident!

37:42.150 --> 37:43.360
How presumptuous, Li Zhen!

37:43.360 --> 37:46.550
How dare you use force against an elder
in front of the clan elders!

37:46.550 --> 37:47.400
Zhen!

37:47.440 --> 37:48.400
Tian Jiangyue,

37:48.650 --> 37:49.800
you've been jumping up and down.

37:49.800 --> 37:51.710
Don't think
I don't know what you're up to.

37:51.710 --> 37:52.880
Today, you just want to use

37:52.880 --> 37:54.440
the clan elders and Eldest Aunt

37:54.440 --> 37:56.070
to force me to hand over the family seal

37:56.070 --> 37:57.930
and to leave the Li family, right?

37:58.000 --> 37:59.150
I'm telling you.

37:59.400 --> 38:01.110
Times have changed.

38:01.350 --> 38:02.830
I won't fulfill your wish.

38:03.320 --> 38:05.110
If I find out you had anything to do

38:05.110 --> 38:06.630
with what happened behind the scenes,

38:06.630 --> 38:08.480
I won't let you off easily!

38:09.550 --> 38:10.960
How arrogant!

38:11.360 --> 38:12.110
Today,

38:12.400 --> 38:14.400
according to our ancestors' rules,

38:14.400 --> 38:16.200
we'll draft a public resolution

38:16.280 --> 38:18.670
and dismiss you as the head of the family!

38:22.320 --> 38:23.760
Rules of our ancestors?

38:24.230 --> 38:25.960
What rules of our ancestors?

38:26.840 --> 38:28.760
You elders seem to have forgotten

38:29.360 --> 38:32.620
that our Eighth Branch
was expelled from the clan long ago.

38:32.800 --> 38:34.550
If we really want to be particular
about it,

38:34.550 --> 38:36.880
I'm not a member of the Li family!

38:36.880 --> 38:37.960
And you

38:38.070 --> 38:39.710
can't control me at all!

38:40.190 --> 38:41.670
Preposterous!

38:41.960 --> 38:42.960
Looks like

38:43.070 --> 38:45.090
we brought back an ungrateful wretch!

38:45.090 --> 38:46.690
If I am an ungrateful wretch,

38:47.000 --> 38:48.190
then you elders

38:48.190 --> 38:49.760
must be blinded!

38:50.150 --> 38:51.670
May I ask you elders,

38:52.070 --> 38:54.360
when I helped the Li family recreate
the ancient lacquer-soot ink

38:54.360 --> 38:56.880
and was framed by them
for stealing the ink recipe,

38:56.880 --> 38:58.110
where were you?

38:58.940 --> 39:00.800
When this ink workshop was destroyed,

39:00.800 --> 39:02.440
and I was trying to win back
the ink merchants

39:02.440 --> 39:04.000
while rebuilding it,

39:04.000 --> 39:05.300
where were you?

39:05.710 --> 39:07.150
When the pine wilt disease was raging

39:07.150 --> 39:08.550
and the Tian family
forcibly requisitioned pine timber,

39:08.550 --> 39:10.360
it was I, Li Zhen,
who came up with the rosin oil solution

39:10.360 --> 39:12.920
to help the Li family
tide over one crisis after another!

39:12.920 --> 39:14.000
Every single one of these things—

39:14.000 --> 39:15.600
have you forgotten them all?

39:16.480 --> 39:17.920
When things went wrong,

39:18.190 --> 39:20.850
I've never seen you
help the Li family even once.

39:21.070 --> 39:22.630
But now you can't even tell
right from wrong

39:22.630 --> 39:24.480
and side with these villains.

39:24.630 --> 39:25.920
I'm telling you!

39:26.440 --> 39:29.970
The Li family was personally entrusted
to me by Seventh Grandmother.

39:29.970 --> 39:32.420
Unless she wakes up

39:32.630 --> 39:34.400
and comes to take it back herself,

39:34.400 --> 39:35.280
no one

39:35.630 --> 39:36.960
shall take

39:37.320 --> 39:39.670
this family seal seal from me!

39:39.760 --> 39:41.070
This is outrageous!

39:41.110 --> 39:41.960
Servants!

39:42.630 --> 39:43.880
Seize this

39:44.510 --> 39:45.570
disobedient girl!

39:45.630 --> 39:47.110
Find

39:47.190 --> 39:48.480
the family seal!

39:48.510 --> 39:49.630
Who dares!

39:50.030 --> 39:51.250
The entire Li clan

39:51.820 --> 39:54.100
no longer recognizes this head.

39:54.480 --> 39:55.740
What are you afraid of?

39:55.760 --> 39:56.920
Get her!

39:57.030 --> 39:59.230
Who says no one recognizes her anymore?

40:11.560 --> 40:12.510
Uncle Jingdong?

40:13.000 --> 40:14.230
You're back?

40:35.730 --> 40:37.120
I, Li Jingdong,

40:38.180 --> 40:39.110
pay my respects.

40:41.400 --> 40:42.590
Elders,

40:43.480 --> 40:44.670
please be seated.

40:51.030 --> 40:51.880
I,

40:53.030 --> 40:55.590
Li Jingdong, the eldest son
of the Sixth Branch of the Li family,

40:55.590 --> 40:58.710
am here to make my position clear
to all the elders.

41:00.590 --> 41:02.000
My niece, Li Zhen,

41:02.920 --> 41:05.000
is the head of the Li family.

41:05.760 --> 41:07.480
If anyone has a problem with that,

41:07.480 --> 41:09.000
come to me.

41:11.350 --> 41:12.350
Third Brother...

41:13.360 --> 41:15.290
Have you forgotten about your leg?

41:16.230 --> 41:18.430
Li Zhen has been expelled from the clan.

41:19.190 --> 41:20.960
How can you stand up for her?

41:21.230 --> 41:22.030
Yes.

41:23.480 --> 41:25.590
She was expelled from the clan,

41:27.320 --> 41:30.510
yet she works tirelessly
for the Li family every day

41:31.510 --> 41:34.640
and has saved the Li family
from disaster several times.

41:35.710 --> 41:37.030
But what about you?

41:38.550 --> 41:40.440
Time and time again,

41:41.400 --> 41:42.800
you have tripped her up

41:43.270 --> 41:44.820
and slung mud at her!

41:49.670 --> 41:50.710
Elders,

41:53.150 --> 41:54.670
I can personally vouch

41:56.590 --> 41:58.880
for my niece, Li Zhen.

42:01.320 --> 42:03.440
Please give her 5 days.

42:03.630 --> 42:04.670
By then,

42:05.190 --> 42:07.510
she will definitely reveal the truth

42:08.110 --> 42:09.070
and

42:09.840 --> 42:13.670
provide a way
to deliver the order on time.

42:14.440 --> 42:15.440
Elders,

42:16.440 --> 42:17.840
what do you think?

42:18.000 --> 42:19.800
What if after 5 days

42:20.280 --> 42:22.010
there is still no explanation?

42:22.320 --> 42:24.180
Then I will step down voluntarily

42:25.030 --> 42:27.960
and won't make things difficult
for the clan elders.

42:29.590 --> 42:30.590
Alright.

42:31.400 --> 42:34.360
Let's leave it at that for today.

42:35.400 --> 42:36.670
We'll see the result

42:37.280 --> 42:38.800
in 5 days.

42:41.230 --> 42:43.960
Take care, Elders.
